---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="About | WeCollab8" description="WeCollab8 helps simplify enterprise IT through collaboration, innovation and practical engineering.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 pb-20 pt-16 md:px-8 md:pb-24 md:pt-20 lg:px-10">
    <p class="eyebrow">About WeCollab8</p>
    <div class="mt-5 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_0.8fr] md:items-start">
      <h1 class="max-w-[13ch] font-display text-5xl leading-tight text-ink md:text-6xl">Enterprise IT should enable the business.</h1>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted">
        <p>Founded in 2019, WeCollab8 Technology Holdings set out to simplify enterprise IT through collaboration and innovation.</p>
        <p>Our work spans infrastructure management, IT service management, enterprise automation, cloud platforms and cloud-native environments. We bring that experience to the design, implementation and ongoing support of enterprise software.</p>
        <p>Our focus is practical: help technology teams spend less effort managing complexity and more time delivering value.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-forest text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-8 px-5 py-14 md:grid-cols-3 md:px-8 lg:px-10">
      <div class="border-t border-white/30 pt-5">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#e8a083]">01 / UNDERSTAND</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl">Start with the system.</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/75">Ground the design in the business context and the environment already in place.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-white/30 pt-5">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#e8a083]">02 / CONNECT</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl">Use open standards.</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/75">Build integrations that help applications and platforms work together.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-white/30 pt-5">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#e8a083]">03 / ENABLE</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl">Make operations easier.</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/75">Apply automation and engineering support to reduce day-to-day friction.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-5 px-5 py-16 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between md:px-8 lg:px-10">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">People behind the work</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl text-ink">Meet our director.</h2>
    </div>
    <a href="/team/" class="text-link w-fit text-sm font-semibold text-forest">Meet Roger D'Souza &rarr;</a>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>